<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 156 AND 195-3 V ZIMBABWE (215) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 156 AND 195-3 V ZIMBABWE (215) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 195 for three in</p>
<p>their second innings at the close on the fourth day of the</p>
<p>second test against Zimbabwe on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 156 and 195-3; Zimbabwe 215.</p>
</text>
